    <div class="condition-preview"><span>无代码条件链</span><code>Condition Engine → Signal Engine → Risk Engine → Paper Broker</code><small>任何模拟订单都必须经过规则和风控，AI 无权绕过该链路。</small></div>
    <template #footer><button class="btn" @click="createDialog = false">取消</button><button class="btn primary" :disabled="!form.accountName || form.initialCash < 10000" @click="createInstance">创建虚拟实例</button></template>
  </el-dialog>
</template>

